"this case, they will automatically fall back to English US."
msgstr ""
"Ba.n co' the^? cho.n ngo^n ngu+~ tu+` trong danh sa'ch se~ ddu+o+.c du`ng bo+? "
"KDE . Ne^'u ngo^n ngu+~ dda^`u tie^n trong danh sa'ch kho^ng du`ng ddu+o+.c, ngo^n"
