"kho^ng ba?n di.ch na`o se~ ddu+o+.c ca`i dda(.t . Ba.n co' the^? la^'y the^m ca'c go'i"
"di.ch cho nhie^`u ngo^n ngu+~ tu+` no+` ma` ba.n la^'y KDE ."
"<p> Chu' y' la` mo^.t so^' chu+o+ng tri`nh chu+a ddu+o+.c di.ch ra ngo^n ngu+~ cu?a ba.n .,"
"trong tru+o+`ng ho+.p ddo', no' se~ tu+. ddo^.ng quay la.i English US ."

